\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Performance profile comparing regularization techniques on indefinite $M$ cases. Only four methods PROJECT, MIRROR, RP\_STAGE\_EM and PM\_STAGE\_EM successfully solved all the 30 cases, with M\_STAGE\_PROJECT as worst-performing method and both RP\_STAGE\_MIRROR, PM\_STAGE\_MIRROR as best-performing method.}}{4}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:performance}{{1}{4}{Performance profile comparing regularization techniques on indefinite $M$ cases. Only four methods PROJECT, MIRROR, RP\_STAGE\_EM and PM\_STAGE\_EM successfully solved all the 30 cases, with M\_STAGE\_PROJECT as worst-performing method and both RP\_STAGE\_MIRROR, PM\_STAGE\_MIRROR as best-performing method}{figure.1}{}}
